---
---
<section class="space-y-4">
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-blue-600">hub</span>
      <span>منصات المتاجر والواتساب المربوطة</span>
    </h2>
    <span class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-medium">ربط بضغطة زر واحدة (1-Click Integration)</span>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
    <!-- Salla Card -->
    <div class="aura-card rounded-2xl p-5 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold border border-emerald-100">
            س
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-gray-900">متجر سلة (Salla)</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Easy Mode OAuth 2.0</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="bg-[#EFF6FF] text-[#1D4ED8] border border-[#BFDBFE] text-xs px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold">جاهز للربط</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        ربط تلقائي لسحب المنتجات، سياسات الشحن، واسترداد السلات المتروكة عبر الواتساب بضغطة واحدة.
      </p>
      <a href="/api/auth/salla/install" target="_blank" class="w-full bg-emerald-50 hover:bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 font-bold py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl text-xs text-center transition flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 border border-emerald-200">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">add_link</span>
        <span>ربط متجر سلة الآن</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Zid Card -->
    <div class="aura-card rounded-2xl p-5 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-purple-50 text-purple-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold border border-purple-100">
            ز
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-gray-900">متجر زد (Zid)</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Dual-Header Auth API</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="bg-[#EFF6FF] text-[#1D4ED8] border border-[#BFDBFE] text-xs px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold">جاهز للربط</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        تكامل كامل مع أحداث طلبات زد وسلاتها المتروكة وحفظ التوكنات بـ AES-256 مشفرة.
      </p>
      <a href="/api/auth/zid/install" target="_blank" class="w-full bg-purple-50 hover:bg-purple-100 text-purple-700 font-bold py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl text-xs text-center transition flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 border border-purple-200">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">add_link</span>
        <span>ربط متجر زد الآن</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- WhatsApp Cloud API Card -->
    <div class="aura-card rounded-2xl p-5 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold border border-blue-100">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">chat</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-gray-900">واتساب الأعمال (Meta)</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Whisper & Vision Enabled</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="bg-[#EFF6FF] text-[#1D4ED8] border border-[#BFDBFE] text-xs px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold">نشط 🟢</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        دعم كامل للبصمات الصوتية (Whisper)، ورؤية وفهم الصور (Vision AI)، والقوائم التفاعلية للأزرار.
      </p>
      <button onclick="toggleSandboxModal()" class="w-full bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 font-bold py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl text-xs text-center transition flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 border border-gray-200">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base text-blue-600">settings</span>
        <span>إعدادات واختبار الواتساب</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
